|System Administrator|
|DiViet system|
|AI Service|
|Visitor|
|System Administrator|
start
:Check the Department of\nCultural Heritage source;
:Enter content, timeline,\nreferences, credited\nimages, 3D model;
:Click Publish;
|DiViet system|
if (Content, cover image\nand reference present?) then (yes)
  :Set as\npublished;
else (no)
  :List what is missing,\nkeep as draft;
  end
endif
|System Administrator|
:Click Translate and\nsummarize with AI;
|AI Service|
:Summarize in Vietnamese;\ntranslate into English,\nKorean, Chinese, Japanese;
|DiViet system|
if (All languages\nsucceeded?) then (yes)
  :Vietnamese, English await\nreview; Korean, Chinese,\nJapanese shown as\nmachine translation;
else (no)
  :Save nothing,\nkeep the old version;
  end
endif
|System Administrator|
if (Vietnamese and\nEnglish correct?) then (approve)
  |DiViet system|
  :Show publicly;
  |AI Service|
  :Retranslate Korean,\nChinese, Japanese from\nthe approved English;
else (reject)
  |DiViet system|
  :Hide it;\nmust translate again;
  end
endif
|Visitor|
:Choose a language;\nsearch with or\nwithout diacritics;
|DiViet system|
:Search the Vietnamese\nand translated text;
|Visitor|
:View the map,\ntimeline and\ndetail page;
|DiViet system|
:Show the chosen\nlanguage; fall back to\nVietnamese if missing;
|Visitor|
:Switch language,\nkeep browsing;
stop
